==Restrictions==
Max # of Deployable Cats: 1

==Battleground==
*1 [[Doge Dark]] spawns as the boss after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*1 [[Mooth]] spawns as the boss after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>.
*1 [[Metal Hippoe]] spawns as the boss.
*1 [[Assassin Bear]] spawns after 900 seconds<sup>27,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Use a fast [[:Category:Critical Hit Cats|critter]] like [[Jurassic Cat (Rare Cat)|Jurassic Cat]] or [[Space Cat (Rare Cat)|Space Cat]] to take care of the Metal Hippoe. For the Mooth, it is recommended that you use [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Swimmer Cat]] to kill it very fast. Use something like [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Ring Girl Cat]] or [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Dancing Flasher Cat]] to wipe out the Doge Dark quickly. Alternatively, [[Hurricat]] can solo this stage with ease.

